<% content_for :title, "About Kevin Skilton" %>

<section class="hero-panel">
  <p class="section-kicker">About Kevin</p>
  <h1 class="hero-title">A builder who cares about how products feel, not just how they work.</h1>
  <p class="hero-copy">I spend my time shaping thoughtful code, polishing user-facing workflows, and making sure the work lands with clarity and confidence.</p>
  <div class="hero-badges">
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kskilt" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="badge badge-cyan">LinkedIn</a>
    <span class="badge badge-slate">Rails, UI, product-driven engineering</span>
    <span class="badge badge-fuchsia">Creative problem solving</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-panel">
  <div class="content-stack">
    <p class="section-kicker">How I work</p>
    <h2 class="panel-title">I care about the story behind the code.</h2>
    <p class="panel-copy">I’m drawn to problems where the right answer is not only technically correct, but also easy to understand, enjoyable to use, and easy to maintain.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="flow-grid">
    <div class="card-panel">
      <p class="card-kicker">Design-informed instincts</p>
      <h3 class="card-title">Polish matters</h3>
      <p class="card-copy">I pay attention to spacing, typography, and the emotional tone of the interface to help software feel more human.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-panel">
      <p class="card-kicker">Product-first thinking</p>
      <h3 class="card-title">Solve the right problem</h3>
      <p class="card-copy">I prefer starting with what users actually need, then using the simplest tools to deliver a solid outcome.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-panel">
      <p class="card-kicker">Collaborative mindset</p>
      <h3 class="card-title">Code is a team sport</h3>
      <p class="card-copy">I enjoy working with designers, PMs, and teammates to turn vague ideas into something useful and reliable.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="note-box">
    <div class="note-title">What I enjoy most</div>
    <p>I like building interfaces that feel deliberate, doing the cleanup work that makes products easier to maintain, and using automation to make everyday developer tasks less painful.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="info-grid">
    <div class="card-panel">
      <p class="card-kicker">Skills</p>
      <h3 class="card-title">Technical craft</h3>
      <p class="card-copy">Rails, Ruby, modern frontend patterns, markdown-based publishing, and lightweight tooling that moves fast without sacrificing quality.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-panel">
      <p class="card-kicker">Character</p>
      <h3 class="card-title">Curiosity & ownership</h3>
      <p class="card-copy">I’m driven by the question “how can this be better?” and I’m willing to do the thoughtful work to answer it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-panel">
      <p class="card-kicker">Outside work</p>
      <h3 class="card-title">Hobbies that matter</h3>
      <p class="card-copy">I enjoy learning new tools, reading about systems design, and taking on creative side projects that keep my thinking sharp.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
